# Universal Framework - Documentation Context

Universal Framework provides backend service integration for DayZ modding including database, Discord, AI chat, messaging, and utility services accessed via the `U()` singleton. Server has full access; players have limited read access to their own data.

| Section | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `UniversalFramework_BestPractices` | **START HERE** - Initialization, UFrameworkReady, client offloading, patterns |
| `UniversalFramework_StatusCodes` | HTTP-style status codes for callbacks (`UF_SUCCESS`, `UF_EMPTY`, etc.) |
| `UniversalFramework_DBHandler_Basics` | Core database operations: `UDBHandler<T>`, Save, Load, typed serialization |
| `UniversalFramework_DBHandler_Advanced` | Queries, Transactions, Updates, pagination, Query classes |
| `UniversalFramework_Discord` | Discord bot integration: roles, DMs, channels, voice, linking |
| `UniversalFramework_DiscordObjects` | Data classes: `UDiscordEmbed`, `UDiscordUser`, `UDiscordMessage` |
| `UniversalFramework_AIChat` | OpenAI chat: `UFAIChatAgent`, `UAIChatAgent<T>`, context, tools |
| `UniversalFramework_AIChat_KnowledgeBase` | Document-backed AI: vector search, KB Manager UI, embedding generation |
| `UniversalFramework_AIVoice` | Text-to-Speech: `TTSGenerate`, `TTSPlay`, voice constants |
| `UniversalFramework_MessageQueues` | Async messaging: `UQueueHandler<T>`, send/receive, polling |
| `UniversalFramework_GlobalHandler` | Server-wide key-value storage: `U().globals()` |
| `UniversalFramework_CronManager` | Scheduled tasks: `runEndless`, `runEndTime`, `runEndCount`, `runOnce` |
| `UniversalFramework_ItemStore` | Entity serialization: `UEntityStore`, `OnUFSave`/`OnUFLoad` |
| `UniversalFramework_TextureSystem` | Dynamic skins: `RegisterTextureAndMaterial`, `SetTexture`, client overrides |
| `UniversalFramework_PlayerMoneyHandling` | Physical currency: `UGetPlayerBalance`, `UAddMoney`, `URemoveMoney` |
| `UniversalFramework_Utilities` | Core utilities: `UUtil`, time, player lookup, config access |
| `UniversalFramework_Utilities_Strings` | String utilities: formatting, sanitization, regex patterns |
| `UniversalFramework_Utilities_Files` | File utilities: file operations, `UJSONHandler<T>` |
| `UniversalFramework_Utilities_Map` | Map utilities: locations, nearest city/town |
| `UniversalFramework_Logger` | Logging: `UFLog.Info/Debug/Err`, log levels, custom loggers |
| `UniversalFramework_API` | External APIs: Steam queries, crypto prices, TTS, random numbers |
| `UniversalFramework_Summary_DesignStructures` | Architecture overview, permissions matrix, documentation index |
